    "biography": {
      "value": "<p>Dark-street Elvani, umbral-leaning, working the VIP loft where the tips are larger and the questions are fewer. Sable is the only wait staff allowed above the stairs, and she keeps a holdout blade in her apron that Vexa pretends not to know about.</p>",
      "director": "<p><strong>Plot hook:</strong> Sable carries envelopes between loft tables for a cut and never opens them. One envelope this week is Aequitas <strong>Writ</strong> paper — she has not looked, she does not know, and she is walking it across the floor tonight.</p><p><strong>Running her:</strong> Noncombatant, but she will not be robbed quietly.</p>",
